Z||000009||trigger||06-20-2001||11:36 PM||||Now my next question is do all the factory sunroof glasses have the same mounting tabs on the front?  (The part that acts like a hinge at the front.)  And do the draing holes get drilled in all 4 corners?  Thanks.||||reg||1
Z||000010||cadaver||06-21-2001||02:35 AM||||Yes all glass panels have the same hinge tab thing.<BR>I dont know about the factory holes But I drilled mine in all four corners. I think the factory holes are like 1/4. I drilled mine at 1/2||||reg||1
